                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Duanmu Fei has Miles Edgeworth's logic, Klavier Gavin's suaveness, and Godot's coffee addiction lol\nI really liked the stories as it also gives me more knowlage on how China is like, not sure if the to be continued will be updated soon with a new case or something like that because I can't search the discussion board when it's filled with chinese only XP\n\nThis game has a variaty of puzzles in the 2nd case which I find pretty hard aside from the password hacking one, even Layton puzzles weren't this hard (so I google translated a guide lol)\nI don't really like how the whole interrogating thing has an actual time limit but since you can just redo it in skip mode and the timer won't skip it's not a huge issue.\nThere are still some spelling or grammar errors in the english patch but not too much that you can't understand what's going on.\nThe camera feature makes me have itchy trigger fingers to take a shot each time a character changes their expression for the photographer achievement XD",
